{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_01_end","storyGroup":"act45side","storySort":3,"storyDependence":"act45side_level_act45side_01_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"SS-1","storyName":"花格窗边的梦想","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"除了祥子，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的成员们都深陷于梦境中。祥子与梦城堡的“主人”莫菲丝达成赌约，前往每个成员的梦境中尝试唤醒她们。然而，祥子一进入若麦的梦境，就被若麦铺天盖地的广告所震惊。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act45side/level_act45side_01_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act45side_01","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":1,"next":3,"characters":["？？？","丰川祥子","莫菲丝","卡尔顿们","沃尔夫","卖力的商贩","匆忙的行人","干练的快递员","祐天寺若麦","菲林群众","激动的粉丝","心动的粉丝","年迈的粉丝"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8a/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness02_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness02_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":8},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>童话书里说，在维多利亚的某处，矗立着一座只有孩子才能看见的城堡。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>城堡里住着几位善良的仙女，她们会定期举办宴会招待孩子们，并用美梦一一实现他们的愿望。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>可具体说起“梦城堡”究竟是何种模样，却没有一个孩子能答得上来。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>精心塑造的美梦，从孩子们离开梦境的那一刻起，就在不断地被淡忘。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>美梦不断被塑造，然后又不断被遗忘。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>重复塑造，重复遗忘。</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":14},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>这一切对于善良而忙碌的仙女们来说，是不是有些过于不公平了？</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":15},{"type":"subtitle","text":"<i>“是的，莫菲丝。”</i>","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":16},{"type":"subtitle","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":18},{"type":"dialog","id":19},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c1/Avg_bg_65_g2_dreamcastlehall.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":24},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","duration":"0.7","id":27},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":28},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"欢迎来到梦城堡，我是这里的现任主人，莫菲丝。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"梦城堡……的主人……不对，你做了什么？！","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"和你梦里演的一样啊？只不过是让你们做了一个梦罢了。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"唉——不过你的梦实在太无趣了，尽是些无聊的东西。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#16$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"（小声）还有那两个……讨厌的家伙。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/90/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你认识爱丽丝……还有贝娜？","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"不熟。","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"她们不是梦里的角色，是真实存在的人？","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我倒希望她们只存在在梦里。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你能不能别老提那两个家伙。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你在和我说话欸！现在我才是这里的主人！","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"快让我离开这里。","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"那不可能。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#15$1","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"最近都没什么孩子来梦城堡了，我怎么可能随便放你走？","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"卡尔顿们又不能说话，沃尔夫只有一个，而且现在说话还说不顺溜。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_2","volume":"1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（失落的哼唧声）","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6f/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"抱、抱歉。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你是因为自己太无聊了，所以才把我关在这个城堡里的吗？","id":64,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"不要说得好像我来者不拒一样。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你的经历都很有意思——记忆里的那些经历，还有那些陌生的场景，我反复研究了很多遍呢。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你偷看了我的记忆？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"那个家伙没有和你说过吗？了解孩子们的过去，也是塑造梦境很重要的一部分。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"但你确实是个例外……","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"明明经历了那么多无法忘却的事情，脑子却还是一如既往地清醒。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"为了弥补这个小小的遗憾，我愿意为你重新塑造一个美梦。正好我们现在面对面，你可以和我说说——","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"沉溺在梦境和过往的痛苦中，都是懦弱的表现。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#20$1","focus":"m","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"呵，你还真是嘴硬！","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"如果按照你说的，没法直面现实的人全都是懦夫的话……","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f1/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-20$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"那这样的人，真的很多呢。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":84},{"type":"dialog","id":85},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snapping","volume":"1","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":88},{"type":"charslot","id":89},{"type":"background","id":90},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bc/Avg_65_i02_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":91},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_craneworking","volume":"0.8","id":93},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":95},{"type":"text","text":"帷幕渐渐拉开，座椅从台下缓缓升起。","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"而座椅上坐着的，是祥子再熟悉不过的人。","id":97},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":98,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"初华……睦？","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"祐天寺……还有八幡？","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……大家怎么都睡着了？","id":101},{"type":"text","text":"周围的一切如舞台布景一般。","id":102},{"type":"text","text":"沉睡的少女们，就是巨大布景中安眠的人偶。","id":103},{"type":"text","text":"无声，无息。","id":104},{"type":"text","text":"祥子一遍遍地尝试唤醒自己的同伴，可无济于事。","id":105},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"别白费力气了——没用的。","id":107},{"type":"dialog","id":108},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/44/Avg_65_i02_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2.5","block":"false","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我对自己的能力还是很有信心的。她们正沉浸在自己的美梦里，你叫不醒她们的。","id":111},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"在我为你们塑造的梦境里有什么不好？","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"罗德岛的朋友们都相信你，这样不好吗？没有任何你不想看到的别离，你也不用隐藏自己 。","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"看看她们，难道你要说她们都是懦夫吗？","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"既然我有办法从你的梦中醒来，她们也一定可以……","id":115},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_strngspllstght","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"s","id":117},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"s","fadetime":"3","id":118},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":119},{"type":"text","text":"突然，祥子感到几股巨大的拉力拽住了自己，等她反应过来时，她的四肢已经被丝线牢牢捆住。","id":120},{"type":"text","text":"无法控制身体的紧张感瞬间侵占了她的思维，她努力地想要保持冷静。","id":121},{"type":"text","text":"然而，紧绷的丝线将她身上一切微弱的抖动毫无保留地放大。","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你这嘴硬的家伙，就不能承认梦境是美好的吗！","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你……","id":124},{"type":"text","text":"祥子努力想办法让自己的呼吸变得平顺。","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"你……似乎对自己的能力很自信。","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"也许在我之前，你的梦境从没有被人打破过。","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"当然！我本来就是这个城堡里最擅长造梦的仙女。","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你的苏醒，只不过是一个意外。再来一次肯定就没问题了！","id":129},{"type":"text","text":"祥子清楚地看到，莫菲丝说出最后那几个字时，表情是咬牙切齿的，可转眼间，她的表情又变得无比天真灿烂。","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"嗯……丰川祥子，对吧？","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"既然你这么自信，那我就跟你打个赌！","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……打赌？","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"嗯！绝对公平的打赌哦！","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":135},{"type":"text","text":"眼前的对手越是露出孩童般的微笑，就越显得无比危险。","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哈哈，很简单！","id":137},{"type":"text","text":"虽然那孩子绕着舞台转着圈，但祥子很清楚她肯定一直在盯着自己。并且，黑暗中还有无数双眼睛也在紧盯着自己。","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我会邀请你进入她们每一个人的梦境，给你唤醒她们的机会。","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"你可以认识她们，了解她们，看看她们到底在梦境中过着怎样的生活。如果你能让她们像你一样醒来，我就让你们离开。","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"如果你失败了，那么她们就得永远留在梦境里！","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……我会把她们都叫醒的。","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"Ave{@nbs}Mujica缺少了任何一个人，我都不会离开。","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"她们每个人都是我挑选出来的、最好的成员。我不会让她们任何一个人受你的摆布。","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哈哈，那可不一定。如果你失败了，你也得重新进入我为你造的梦境。","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"这次你一定不会再醒过来的。我会让你忘记以前的一切痛苦，自愿活在里面。","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"怎么样？还是说，你想收回之前说的那些大话了？","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"就算我现在拒绝，你也不可能放我走吧？","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哈哈！你倒是挺聪明嘛！","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"丰川祥子，我很期待你在她们的梦境里，露出绝望又无助的表情。","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我会向你证明——你逃不掉的。","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_strngspllmgc","volume":"1","id":154},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":155},{"type":"cg","duration":"1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":157},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":158},{"type":"text","text":"莫菲丝手指轻动，祥子的视线顿时变得模糊不清。","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"唔——！","id":160},{"type":"dialog","id":161},{"type":"image","fadetime":"0.2","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":163},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_bg_65_g8_interviewstage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":164},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":165},{"type":"background","fadetime":"0.2","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":167},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_65_i04.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":169},{"type":"image","fadetime":"0.2","id":170},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":171},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_65_i07_2.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"0.2","id":173},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/dd/Avg_bg_bg_light.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":175},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_tinnitus","volume":"0.8","id":176},{"type":"image","fadetime":"1.5","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":178},{"type":"text","text":"五颜六色、变异扭曲的光影涌入祥子的脑海中。","id":179},{"type":"text","text":"舞台下喧闹欢呼的人群。","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"雨夜中的一抹黑影。","id":181},{"type":"text","text":"坐在椅子上的孤独少女。","id":182},{"type":"text","text":"还有无数个无法分清的人影。","id":183},{"type":"dialog","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"享受我为你们而造的美梦吧——","id":186},{"type":"dialog","id":187},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_dream_change","volume":"1","id":188},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_blackmask","layer":"2","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":191},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":192},{"type":"bg","duration":"0.1","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":193},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_bg_bg_lmstreet_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":195},{"type":"bgeffect","id":196},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":197},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_traffic_amb","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"1","id":198},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":199},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":200},{"type":"text","text":"川流不息的车辆，高耸入云的建筑，还有无处不在的霓虹灯牌。","id":201},{"type":"dialog","id":202},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"0.5","id":203},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","duration":"1","id":204},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"我从梦境里出来了？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"不对……","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":209},{"type":"charslot","id":210},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nightoflongmen_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_nightoflongmen_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":211,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_303_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卖力的商贩","text":"新鲜出锅的鳞丸啊——快来看看！","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_303_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_304_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的行人","text":"搞快点咯，后面人都等着呢！活动要迟到了啊！","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6a/Avg_avg_npc_304_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_033","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"干练的快递员","text":"你好！你的货——人不在家？那我放门口可以吗？","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_npc_033.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"现代的建筑，动物的耳朵……这里究竟是哪里？","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":220},{"type":"charslot","id":221},{"type":"text","text":"名为“鳞丸”的小吃包装上，印着“龙门传统手作”。","id":222},{"type":"text","text":"行人搭乘的载具涂着硕大的“龙门交通”标志，从眼前疾驰而过。","id":223},{"type":"text","text":"干练的小哥衣服上的公司名称，同样以“龙门”开头。","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"龙门……这里究竟是谁的梦境？","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":227},{"type":"charslot","id":228},{"type":"text","text":"一个熟悉的声音从祥子头顶上传来——","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"晚上好喵呣喵呣~~","id":230},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":232},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":233},{"type":"charslot","id":234},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_bg_65_g8_interviewstage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":235},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.05","fillto":"0.05","fadetime":"0.01","id":236},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.05","fillto":"0.05","fadetime":"0.01","id":237},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","id":238},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":239},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":240},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":242},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#5$3","duration":"0.7","id":243},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#5$3","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"粉丝朋友们好呀，我是新人演员若麦！","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"我最新主演的电影《少女鼓手》已经上映咯，希望大家可以多去影院支持若麦呢~","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":248},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":249},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":250},{"type":"charslot","id":251},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_bg_65_g8_interviewstage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":252},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.05","fillto":"0.05","fadetime":"0.01","id":253},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.05","fillto":"0.05","fadetime":"0.01","id":254},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","id":255},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":257},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":259},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菲林群众","text":"凌晨三点！彻夜难眠！超想吃鳞丸怎么办？！","id":260},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#5$3","focus":"m","id":261},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"那当然是吃“喵速达”鳞丸啦！","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"“喵速达”鳞丸，若麦和云兽都喜欢吃的鳞丸！等你下单哦~","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"charslot","id":267},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_bg_65_g8_interviewstage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":268},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.05","fillto":"0.05","fadetime":"0.01","id":269},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.05","fillto":"0.05","fadetime":"0.01","id":270},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","id":271},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":276},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#3$3","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"十分钟化完一套妆不是问题！","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"“梦绘人”系列轻巧装，用最简单的步骤化出一百分的妆容！","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bb/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-3$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#5$3","focus":"m","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"和我一起，成为最想成为的自己吧~","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":282},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":283},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":284},{"type":"charslot","id":285},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4f/Avg_bg_65_g8_interviewstage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":286},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.05","fillto":"0.05","fadetime":"0.01","id":287},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.05","fillto":"0.05","fadetime":"0.01","id":288},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","id":289},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","fadetime":"0.01","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4185_amoris_1#5$3","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"祐天寺若麦","text":"若麦也爱你们哟~","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/14/Avg_avg_4185_amoris_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":296},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":297},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":298},{"type":"charslot","id":299},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_bg_bg_lmstreet_1.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":300},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"curtain","id":302},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":305},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"怎么梦里全是她的广告……","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_033","focus":"m","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的粉丝","text":"我要疯了啊啊啊啊！！！","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_npc_033.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"呃……！","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_033","focus":"m","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的粉丝","text":"若麦她……她也太可爱了吧！","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_npc_033.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的粉丝","text":"每个表情、每个动作、每句话，都在撩拨我的心弦啊！","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_npc_033.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"心动的粉丝","text":"真的、真的能变得和若麦一样漂亮吗？！","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"心动的粉丝","text":"——我要买她的同款！","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"这里堵得水泄不通，不会都是来看她的吧？","id":319,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d9/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1638_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":320},{"type":"dialogue","name":"年迈的粉丝","text":"当然……若麦，就和自己的女儿一样可爱啊……","id":321,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/96/Avg_avg_npc_1638_1$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"年迈的粉丝","text":"呵呵呵呵呵……","id":322},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":323},{"type":"multiline","name":"年迈的粉丝","text":"咳咳咳咳咳……","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"……您没事吧！","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_033","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"激动的粉丝","text":"若麦，若麦！我看见她了！！","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/46/Avg_avg_npc_033.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_032","focus":"m","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"心动的粉丝","text":"在哪？在哪？快让让，我要过去！！","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/94/Avg_avg_npc_032.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":331},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":332},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_audience_chaos","volume":"1","id":333},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":334},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":335},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":336},{"type":"charslot","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4182_oblvns_1#6$2","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"哎，等等！请不要推挤……！","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"丰川祥子","text":"祐天寺——！！","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_avg_4182_oblvns_1-6$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":341},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":342},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":343},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":344},{"type":"charslot","id":345},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e4/Avg_bg_65_g10_dreamcastlestage.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":346},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#19$1","focus":"m","id":347},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":348},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":349,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈……没想到一开始就这么狼狈啊，太有意思啦！","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-19$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1937_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":353},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_yingying_ked_1","volume":"1","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡尔顿们","text":"（欢快的哼唧声）","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_avg_npc_1937_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"为、为什么？","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/11/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"嗯？","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/40/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"没、没必要……她、她，赢、赢不了……","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#17$1","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"话都讲不清楚，你就没必要想这种问题了。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-17$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1938_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"沃尔夫","text":"……","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_1938_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1942_1#18$1","focus":"m","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"在她进入梦境的这段时间里……我一定能找到失误的原因。","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"莫菲丝","text":"我就是这座城堡里最有天赋的造梦师。","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1942_1-18$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":369},{"type":"charslot","id":370},{"type":"text","text":"莫菲丝盯着正在沉睡的少女，不再言语。","id":371},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":374},{"type":"charslot","id":375},{"type":"image","id":376}],"characters":["？？？","丰川祥子","莫菲丝","卡尔顿们","沃尔夫","卖力的商贩","匆忙的行人","干练的快递员","祐天寺若麦","菲林群众","激动的粉丝","心动的粉丝","年迈的粉丝"]}